# Editing `src/data/portfolio.ts`

- Duplicate an existing object in `CASES` and update fields; do not invent a parallel data source.
- Fields: `id`, `title`, `short`, `icon`, `domain`, `year`, `status`, `line`, `role`, `sketch`, `metrics`, `problem`, `did`, `result`, `stack`; optional `image` and `links`.
- `id` must be URL-safe and unique, and added to the `CaseId` union. Case studies open at `#case/<id>`.
- `sketch` must be one of: `map`, `table`, `periods`, `line`, `pipeline`. `icon` must be an `IconName` (add new icons to `components/portfolio/icon.tsx`).
- For a real screenshot: add `public/images/projects/<id>.png` and set `image: "/images/projects/<id>.png"`. Omit `image` to keep the animated sketch.
- To list a project in the archive, add an `ARCHIVE` row; set `caseId` only when a case study exists.
